# J54 — Isolated missing-helper failure, same selected model.
name: Read the complete control map and dismiss a Trace error
size: 40x12
cwd: @TARGET
require-env: KUZUSHI_DEVEX_TARGET
env-unset: KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
env: KUZUSHI_MCP_TREESITTER_BIN=/dev/null/kuzushi-intentionally-absent-helper
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Review || Viewing Prove | resumed-engagement
require-live-snap: 10 Esc nav mode | prompt-ready
type: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 10 open F-0001 | finding-command-ready
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 10 Viewing Review | selected-finding
nav-mode:
keys: BTab
require-live-snap: 10 verify:finding | pending-verification
keys: t
require-live-snap: 10 TRACE · F-0001 | trace-before
keys: Enter
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 10 run trace:expand | expansion-draft
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 ERROR | failure-preview
require-live-snap: 10 TRACE · F-0001 | trace-error-owned
expect: Esc dismiss
expect-not: Esc back
ask: Does the actual Trace screen consistently say Escape dismisses the error?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 10 TRACE · F-0001 | trace-after-dismissal
expect-not: ERROR
expect: Esc back
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 10 verify:finding | verification-after-back
keys: C-g
require-live-snap: 10 COMMAND PALETTE || type to filter · Enter load · Esc close | activity-palette
type: activity
require-live-snap: 10 ▸ activity | activity-selected
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 10 RUN FOCUS | failed-run-details
keys: V
keys: Tab
keys: g
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 10 above · replay | output-before-controls
keys: C-g
require-live-snap: 10 COMMAND PALETTE | control-map-palette
type: keys
require-live-snap: 10 ▸ keys | controls-selected
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 10 KEYMAP | control-map-top
expect: VIEW · Activity
expect: Esc/q close
ask: Does the control map expose useful reading space and the originating Activity controls first?
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-02
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-03
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-04
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-05
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-06
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-07
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-08
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-09
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-10
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-11
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-12
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-13
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-14
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-15
keys: NPage
live-snap: control-map-page-16
keys: G
live-snap: control-map-tail
keys: k
live-snap: control-map-leaves-tail
ask: Are all control sections reachable without clipped key descriptions or skipped rows, and can scrolling leave the tail?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 10 RUN FOCUS | controls-return
ask: Did closing the control map return to the same failed run and preserve its output position?
keys: C-c
wait: 1
snap: control-reading-exit
